## 2. SOLAR ICONS CATALOG (SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH)

The project preloads `vendor/iconify-icon.min.js` and `vendor/solar-icons-bundle.js`.
- **Syntax:** `<iconify-icon icon="solar:ICON-NAME" width="18" height="18"></iconify-icon>`
- **Visual Hierarchy Rule (iOS HIG):**
  - Use **`-linear`** variant for inactive tabs, secondary actions, input prefixes, and chevrons.
  - Use **`-bold`** or **`-bold-duotone`** variant for active tabs, Bento KPI headers, primary CTAs, and status alerts.

